fact WorkItem(id: "WI-130", description: some(value: "Proposal 030 phase γ.3 — topological ordering of proof discharge. Per phase γ.3 of docs/proposals/030-theorem-registry.md: prove discharges in dependency order — citers wait for cited. Today's collect_proof_records sort_by(rule.cmp) is alphabetical; for lf1 this happens to put cited rules first because of naming, but a rename would break the within-invocation chain (γ.2's discharged_this_run wouldn't have the cite ready). Implement Kahn's topological sort over the  graph; cycle = load-time error. Acceptance: cargo-test passes; new test verifies a chain (B uses A) with B coming first alphabetically still discharges in the right order (A first, then B); a circular-using pair errors loudly."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-04-28T14:18:22Z"))
